<title>USA: Renal Care Group sets three-for-two split.</title>
<headline>Renal Care Group sets three-for-two split.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renal Care Group Inc said Friday its directors had approved a three-for-two stock split, payable July 25, record July 7.</p>
<p>The nephrology service company currently has 15.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it expects the additional shares outstanding to enhance the trading activity, visibility and liquidity of its stock.</p>
